  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until lightly browned.",
    "Add grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chopped tomato and cook until softened.",
    "Add soya beans, curry powder, turmeric, and salt, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 5 minutes, stirring frequently, until the soya beans are lightly toasted.",
    "Stir in lemon juice and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
